The Terraform program below creates an AWS Connect bot association with an Amazon Lex bot. It includes the necessary IAM role for the Lex bot and configures the Lex bot with the required attributes. The `aws_connect_bot_association` resource is configured to associate the Lex bot with a specified Amazon Connect instance.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "iam_role" {
  name = "lex-bot-role"

  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
