This Terraform program creates a DynamoDB table and enables Contributor Insights on it. The table is configured with a simple schema and provisioned capacity. The Contributor Insights resource is linked to the DynamoDB table using the table name.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

resource "aws_dynamodb_table" "example_dynamodb_table" {
  name           = "ExampleDynamoDBTable"
  billing_mode   = "PROVISIONED"
  read_capacity  = 5
  write_capacity = 5
  hash_key       = "UserId"

