This Terraform configuration creates a serverless MSK cluster in the `us-east-2` region. It includes a VPC, two subnets in different availability zones, a security group, and the MSK serverless cluster itself. The configuration ensures that all dependencies are correctly set up, and it uses the AWS provider with the specified version constraints.

