### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"  # Specify your desired AWS region
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket" "mybucket" {
  bucket = "mybucket"  # Ensure this bucket name is unique across all existing bucket names in your AWS account
