### Description:
This Terraform configuration sets up the infrastructure for a video streaming site using AWS Load Balancing. It includes an Application Load Balancer (ALB), a Target Group, and two EC2 instances to handle the video streaming load. The Load Balancer distributes incoming traffic across the two instances.

### Terraform HCL Program:

